{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p034a","title":"诸葛亮赠巾帼激战辛毗持节止司马懿","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p034a-account","label":"裴注·魏氏春秋","text":"诸葛亮赠巾帼激战辛毗持节止司马懿","evidence":["mingdi-e-p034a-q"]},{"id":"xinyang-a-81da74cd4b28e7a3b3da","label":"正文","text":"青龙二年辛毗使持节为司马懿军师禁战","evidence":["xinyang-q-42b344502e44d8288ee9"]},{"id":"xinyang-a-73611b8798af8a41461a","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"辛毗屡止司马懿进攻诸葛亮","evidence":["xinyang-q-21a13d10568c4be7741d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"激战","evidence":["mingdi-e-p034a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0364","role":"欲战","evidence":["mingdi-e-p034a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0203","role":"制止","evidence":["mingdi-e-p034a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"任命禁战","evidence":["xinyang-q-42b344502e44d8288ee9"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":234,"label":"渭南相持时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y234","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o037","basis":"渭南相持时"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-p034a-q","mingdi-q-o037","mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-p034a-q","source_order":[3,268,"P034a"],"order":857}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0203","name":"辛毗","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0364","name":"司马懿","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p034a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-4d25600567f553cec181","layer":"pei","quote":"亮既屡遣使交书，又致巾帼妇人之饰，以怒宣王。宣王将出战，辛毗杖节奉诏，勒宣王及军吏以下，乃止。","attribution":"裴注·魏氏春秋","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-66f0358ba47d7120f1f4","start":12,"end":59},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：青龙二年（公元 234）。己未：旧历初四日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":252,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-6c0753fe684a18a3a281","start":0,"end":28},{"id":"mingdi-q-o037","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-ff97c2d326d0fc08a9de","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，（乙）〔己〕未〖1〗，太白犯荧惑。癸酉〖2〗，诏曰：“‘鞭作官刑〖3〗’，所以纠慢怠也〖4〗；而顷多以无辜死。其减鞭杖之制〖5〗，著于令。”三月，庚寅〖6〗，山阳公薨；帝素服发哀〖7〗，遣使持节，典护丧事。己酉〖8〗，大赦。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118},{"id":"xinyang-q-21a13d10568c4be7741d","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-d40b1e6651fa7067c812","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏略》曰：“宣王数数欲进攻，毗禁不听。宣王虽能行意，而每屈于毗。”","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c34299717199cc9e9047","start":0,"end":37},{"id":"xinyang-q-42b344502e44d8288ee9","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-2d0fdd901b2e411418bb","layer":"original","quote":"青龙二年，诸葛亮率众出渭南〖24〗。先是，大将军司马宣王数请与亮战〖25〗，明帝终不听。是岁，恐不能禁，乃以毗为大将军军师，使持节。六军皆肃，准毗节度〖26〗，莫敢犯违。﹝二﹞","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":88}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
